#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:2
msgid "|morpheus| UI not loading after upgrade or reconfigure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:4
msgid "Problem:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:5
msgid "The |morpheus| ui does not load after performing an upgrade."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:7
msgid "Common Causes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:8
msgid "The morpheus-ui has not finished loading"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:9
#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:23
msgid ""
"The morpheus-ui was not fully stopped before reconfigure, or not started "
"after reconfigure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:10
#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:38
msgid ""
"|morpheus| was forced to restart or shut down while the database schema "
"was being migrated during an upgrade"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:12
msgid "Solutions:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:13
msgid "The morpheus-ui has not finished loading."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:15
msgid ""
"An easy way to see when the ui is finished loading and running is to tail"
" the ui current file and look for the morpheus logo with version and "
"start time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:17
msgid "morpheus-ctl tail morpheus-ui"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:21
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:21
msgid ""
"After running `morpheus-ctl start morpheus-ui`, the |morpheus| ui takes "
"around 3 minutes to run depending on hardware."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:25
msgid ""
"The morpheus ui must be stopped prior to running morpheus-ctl reconfigure"
" when upgrading. Sometimes running morpheus-ctl stop morpheus-ui will "
"timeout and the ui is not actually stopped. If stopping the ui does "
"timeout, run morpheus-ctl kill morpheus-ui prior to reconfigure, and be "
"sure to run morpheus-ctl start morpheus-ui after reconfigure is "
"completed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:28
msgid "If you ran a reconfigure before stopping the ui, run:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:30
msgid ""
"sudo morpheus-ctl kill morpheus-ui\n"
"sudo morpheus-ctl reconfigure\n"
"sudo morpheus-ctl start morpheus-ui"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:36
msgid "Wait for the ui to come up."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:40
msgid ""
"If the ui fails to start and you see the error ``Invocation of init "
"method failed; nested exception is liquibase.exception.LockException: "
"Could not acquire change log lock.  Currently locked by morpheus`` it "
"likely means morpheus was forced to restart or shut down while the "
"database schema was being migrated during an upgrade, and the lock was "
"not released."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:42
msgid ""
"To release the lock, you will need to run a mysql query. You will need to"
" install mysql-client on the morpheus appliance, and grab the password "
"for morpheus mysql. The username and db name are both morpheus. The "
"password to login to mysql can be found in the application.yml file "
"located at ``/opt/morpheus/conf/application.yml``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:44
msgid "Then run the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:46
msgid "mysql -u morpheus -p -h 127.0.0.1 morpheus"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:50
msgid "At the prompt, enter the mysql password from the application.yml"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:52
msgid "Then run:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:54
msgid "DELETE FROM DATABASECHANGELOGLOCK;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:58
msgid "Then restart morpheus-ui:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:60
msgid "sudo morpheus-ctl restart morpheus-ui"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:64
msgid "If the restart timesout, run:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_UI_Not_Loading.rst:66
msgid ""
"sudo morpheus-ctl kill morpheus-ui\n"
"sudo morpheus-ctl start morpheus-ui"
msgstr ""

